{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/314098-resisting-power-and-spoofing","id":314098,"title":"Resisting Power and Spoofing","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-16T19:05:07-08:00","id":314098,"title":"Resisting Power and Spoofing","content":"Something that comes up a lot in our game is the idea of spoofing as it relates to resisting supernatural powers.<br /> <br /> As an example, let's say a Supernatural Being uses a power called 'BECOME A CHICKEN' on a Demon. This power turns mortal beings into chickens for the duration of the scene.<br /> <br /> Can the Demon spoof?<br /> <br /> If the Demon spoofs, are they obligated to accept the concequences of the power as though they were mortal?<br /> <br /> Can they opt not to spoof?<br /> <br /> A further outgrowth happened in our game tonight when somebody wanted to use Identity Theft to test to see if an unconscious captive was an Unchained. 'If it's Unchained, Identity Theft won't work' they reasoned. Would an Unchained be able to spoof that?<br /> <br /> If they DID spoof it, would Identity Theft work?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3386-piff","name":"Piff","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3386_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"442"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-16T19:47:25-08:00","id":314151,"title":"","content":"Well, you wouldn't need to spoof that power because it isn't detecting whether you're human or not.<br /> <br /> Instead, you'd be resisting or contesting it with your Cover, which could be very high and make it unlikely to succeed.<br /> <br /> Pretty sure Identity Theft wouldn't work on a Demon, but it also wouldn't work on a lot of other things. <br /> <br /> I think the key here is that using powers as Demon detectors isn't a great idea, and all it's likely to suggest is that they're either a very resistant human or a supernatural being which might be worse than a Demon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}